02:31:59.860 --> 02:32:08.100
Because Bitcoin has no way to rotate a key, the only way out is for victims to generate a brand new seed and move their coins with an actual on-chain transaction.

02:32:08.440 --> 02:32:14.640
But of course, because this is Bitcoin, every transaction waits in the public mempool until a miner includes it in a block,

02:32:14.800 --> 02:32:19.100
